            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The original version of this article unfortunately contained a mistake. The name of the main component released by Nicrophorus defodiens in Fig. 1a should read &quot;Fuscumyl acetate&quot;, not &quot;Fuscumol&quot;.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
